        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "be603581-9a10-5424-80c1-693fa91a15a5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Thug Mentality 1999, Uni5 the Prequel: The Untold Story\n- People: Krayzie Bone, Gangsta Boo, Lola Mitchell\n- Groups: Bone Thugs-n-Harmony, The Marley Brothers\n- Topics: guest appearances, debut solo albums\n\nFacts:\n- Thug Mentality 1999 is the debut solo album by American rapper Krayzie Bone.\n- Thug Mentality 1999 is a double-disc album with guest appearances by Bone Thugs-n-Harmony, Mariah Carey, The Marley Brothers, Big Pun, Fat Joe, Cuban Link, Gangsta Boo, E-40, 8 Ball & MJG, Kurupt, Treach, and Snoop Dogg.\n- Lola Mitchell, born on August 7, 1979, is the American rapper Gangsta Boo, also known as Lady Boo, and she is from Memphis, Tennessee.\n- Uni5 the Prequel: The Untold Story is an album by Bone Thugs-N-Harmony that includes cuts and songs from other releases such as Strength & Loyalty and Krayzie Bone's Thug Mentality 1999.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
